        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.726,
            0.9,
            0.791
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "When "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\angle \\mathrm { C i \\vec { s } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " very close to "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0 ^ { \\circ } , \\angle \\mathrm { A }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is very close to "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "9 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , side AC is nearly the same as side BC, and so sin A is very close to 1. Also when "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\angle \\mathrm { A }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is very close to "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "9 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\angle \\mathrm { C }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is very close to "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , and the side AB is nearly zero, so cos A is very close to 0."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.799,
            0.7,
            0.818
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "So, we define : sin "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathbf { 9 0 ^ { \\circ } } = \\mathbf { 1 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and cos "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathbf { 9 0 ^ { \\circ } }   =   \\mathbf { 0 }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.435,
            0.967,
            0.563,
            0.982
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Reprint 2026-27"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.828,
            0.748,
            0.847
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Now, why don’t you find the other trigonometric ratios of "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "9 0 ^ { \\circ } ?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.857,
            0.9,
            0.899
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We shall now give the values of all the trigonometric ratios of "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0 ^ { \\circ } , 3 0 ^ { \\circ } , 4 5 ^ { \\circ } , 6 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "9 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " in Table 8.1, for ready reference."
            }
          ]
        }
